{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32148","headline":"走马楼三更曲 · 温庭筠","name":"走马楼三更曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春姿暖气昏神沼，李树拳枝紫芽小。\n玉皇夜入未央宫，长火千条照栖鸟。\n马过平桥通画堂，虎幡龙戟风飘扬。\n帘间清唱报寒点，丙舍无人遗烬香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}